          %h3#complex_orientation Complex orientation
          %p
            An
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %msub
                    %mi E
                    %mn ∞
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} E_\infty
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/complex+oriented+cohomology+theory"} complex oriented cohomology theory
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi E
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} E
            is indeed equipped with a universal complex orientation given by an
            = succeed "-ring" do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %msub
                      %mi E
                      %mn ∞
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} E_\infty
            = succeed "," do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi MU
                    %mo →
                    %mi E
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} MU \to E
            = succeed "." do
              %a{:href => "complex+oriented+cohomology+theory#InTermsOfGenera"} here
          %h2#related_concepts Related concepts
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/differential+Thom+class"} differential Thom class
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/differential+orientation"}> differential orientation
                ,
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/fiber+integration+in+differential+cohomology"} fiber integration in differential cohomology
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/%28infinity%2C1%29-vector+bundle"} (infinity,1)-vector bundle
          %h2#references References
          %p
            Discussion in terms of
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Thom+classes"} Thom classes
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Frank+Adams"}> Frank Adams
                , part III, section 10 of
                = succeed "," do
                  %em
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Stable+homotopy+and+generalised+homology"} Stable homotopy and generalised homology
            %li#Kochman96
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Stanley+Kochman"}> Stanley Kochman
                , section 4.3 of
                = succeed "," do
                  %em
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Bordism%2C+Stable+Homotopy+and+Adams+Spectral+Sequences"} Bordism, Stable Homotopy and Adams Spectral Sequences
            %li#Rudyak98
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Yuli+Rudyak"}> Yuli Rudyak
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em In Thom spectra, Orientability and Cobordism
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "http://www.maths.ed.ac.uk/~aar/papers/rudyakthom.pdf"} pdf
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Jacob+Lurie"}> Jacob Lurie
                , lecture 5 of
                = succeed "," do
                  %em
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Chromatic+Homotopy+Theory"} Chromatic Homotopy Theory
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "http://www.math.harvard.edu/~lurie/252xnotes/Lecture5.pdf"} pdf
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/eom"}> eom
                ,
                %em
                  %a{:href => "http://eom.springer.de/o/o070200.htm"} Orientation
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Manifold+Atlas"}> Manifold Atlas
                ,
                %em
                  %a{:href => "http://www.map.mpim-bonn.mpg.de/Orientation_of_manifolds_in_generalized_cohomology_theories"} Orientation of manifolds in generalized cohomology theories
          %p
            In the generality of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/equivariant+vector+bundles"} equivariant vector bundles
            and
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/equivariant+complex+oriented+cohomology+theory"} equivariant complex oriented cohomology theory
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Steven+Costenoble"}> Steven Costenoble
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Peter+May"} Peter May
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Stefan+Waner"} Stefan Waner
              = succeed "," do
                %em Equivariant orientation theory
              %p
                Volume 3, Number 2 (2001), 265-339 (
                %a{:href => "https://projecteuclid.org/euclid.hha/1139840256"}> euclid:hha/1139840256
                )
          %p
            A comprehensive account of the general abstract perspective (with predecessors in
            = succeed ")" do
              %a{:href => "#AndoHopkinsRezk10"} Ando-Hopkins-Rezk 10
          %ul
            %li#ABGHR
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Matthew+Ando"}> Matthew Ando
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Andrew+Blumberg"} Andrew Blumberg
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/David+Gepner"} David Gepner
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Michael+Hopkins"} Michael Hopkins
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Charles+Rezk"} Charles Rezk
                %em Units of ring spectra and Thom spectra
                (
                %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/0810.4535"}> arXiv:0810.4535
                )
            %li#ABG10
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Matthew+Ando"}> Matthew Ando
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Andrew+Blumberg"} Andrew Blumberg
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/David+Gepner"} David Gepner
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Twists of K-theory and TMF
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Jonathan+Rosenberg"} Jonathan Rosenberg
                = succeed "," do
                  %em
                    Superstrings, Geometry, Topology, and
                    = succeed "-algebras" do
                      %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                        %semantics
                          %mrow
                            %msup
                              %mi C
                              %mo *
                          %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} C^*
                = succeed "," do
                  %a{:href => "http://www.ams.org/bookstore-getitem/item=PSPUM-81"} vol 81
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/1002.3004"} arXiv:1002.3004
          %p Lecture notes on this include
          %ul
            %li#Hopkins
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Mike+Hopkins"} Mike Hopkins
              (notes by
              = succeed ")," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Andr%C3%A9+Henriques"} André Henriques
              %em The String orientation of tmf
              (
              %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/0805.0743"}> arXiv:0805.0743
              )
          %p
            which are motivated towards constructing the
            = succeed "," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/string+orientation+of+tmf"} string orientation of tmf
          %ul
            %li#AndoHopkinsRezk10
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Matthew+Ando"}> Matthew Ando
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Mike+Hopkins"} Mike Hopkins
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Charles+Rezk"} Charles Rezk
              = succeed "," do
                %em Multiplicative orientations of KO-theory and the spectrum of topological modular forms
              = succeed ")" do
                %a{:href => "http://www.math.uiuc.edu/~mando/papers/koandtmf.pdf"} pdf
          %p For an informal exposition in terms of spectra, see
          %ul
            %li
              Mattia Coloma,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Domenico+Fiorenza"} Domenico Fiorenza
              = succeed "," do
